# Prisma migration SQL files must stay LF-terminated. Prisma records the checksum of
# the RAW file bytes in _prisma_migrations (it does NOT normalize CRLF->LF — verified
# empirically against Prisma 6.19.3), so a CRLF checkout would make the on-disk
# SHA-256 disagree with the recorded checksum. Pinning eol=lf keeps them identical on
# every platform, including Windows dev machines.
packages/database/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf
